WEBVTT

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.090
My name is Yamato Yura.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:33.550
Pleased to meet you all.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.700
I'll form a unit with her,

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.020
so you girls will proceed with formation bravo.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:44.710
Let's go.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:02.080
STELLA GIRLS' ACADEMY

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:02.080
HIGH SCHOOL DIVISION C  CLUB

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.580
I decided this myself

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:08.580
I decided that relying on chance

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:14.090
is just so ridiculously fruitless

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:19.050
I dwelled in my fantasies too much

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:24.970
I'm going to leave my safety zone behind

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:29.890
I try to keep my future in my crosshairs,

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:34.190
and even though my aim is unsteady,

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:37.530
I will hold my head high

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.200
I'll change my life,

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:44.240
and the gray rules that govern it

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:50.080
even if I trip and stumble on the way

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:56.000
Others are guiding me, but I will walk

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.720
My footprints in this world are so colorful

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:22.700
War buddies never live long.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.140
Hey, that girl with the short hair...

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:31.400
Eyeing all the cute girls is always the first thing you do.

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.220
Stay focused.

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:37.200
Well, she is cute, but that's not what I meant.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.380
Wasn't she with Stella?

00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:43.800
Zoinks! You're right!

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.460
Yeah...

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.640
It's Yamato Yura.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:51.420
Why's she with Meisei of all places?

00:02:51.420 --> 00:02:54.290
Aira, heard anything from your sister?

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.900
No, nothing...

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:58.900
This is news to me.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:13.550
<i>Where's my backup?</i>

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:23.840
Clear!

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:25.050
Hit!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.560
Got that?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.130
Back me up.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:34.030
Roger.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.030
<i>They hold both flanks?</i>

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.390
<i>I'll go.</i>

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.510
<i>Wait here and stand by. </i>

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:49.080
Hit!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.400
I'm hit, too.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:55.530
<i>One on the left, right, and center. Three in all.</i>

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.380
<i>Even if they get me...</i>

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.090
<i>I can hit two in return!</i>

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.100
<i>A suicide attack?</i>

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:15.810
Hit!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.160
Hit!

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:18.390
I'm hit!

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:28.340
Meisei Girls' Academy has won the skirm on ground B.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.200
We did it!

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:32.330
We've won, Rin.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.820
So it seems.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:50.890
This is big!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:54.060
Oh, it's just you.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.600
What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.070
Look, this is big.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.610
Check this out.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.410
Looks kinda like Yura, right?

00:05:03.370 --> 00:05:04.800
This...

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:06.530
Huh? What's up?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.530
It's Yura!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.060
But that's...

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:10.950
She's from Meisei...

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.410
It's Haruna Rin!

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.870
Aira sent me this.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.840
It looks like she's fighting in Meisei's airsoft club.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.490
That makes no sense.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:24.420
Why would she join Meisei?

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:29.810
Yura's commuting from her parent's place now, right?

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.390
I think so.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:35.080
Maybe a headhunter got her.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.940
No, maybe they're trying to spite us.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:38.810
I hope not...

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.200
Whatever!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:43.610
Let's just ask her ourselves.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.610
Mom

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:43.640
Incoming Call

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.470
C'mon, Sono, let's take her back.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.370
Nah, leave her be.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.870
What? Why?!

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:54.450
Hey, Sono!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:04.130
Today may be a medic battle, but you must still stay alert.

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.190
Repeat the rules.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:08.590
Call for a medic if you get hit.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:14.060
When the combat medic has given you a bandage, you can rejoin the fight.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:19.310
The winner is the team with fewer applied bandages at the end of the game.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:23.860
Let's use formation echo in light of our previous battle.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:28.530
But if we use that formation, then I'd be...

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.490
The combat medic.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.870
Why?

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.430
I think I'm better on offense...

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:39.440
This decision is based on our previous battle.

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:41.260
I won't allow dissent.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:41.880
But...

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:48.220
You will respond to medic calls and hand out bandages.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:53.710
Make sure not to get hit, or we'll essentially lose.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:00.120
You can only attack during the last five minutes.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:03.980
But even then, you should prioritize your medic duties.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.640
Take up your positions.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.240
Okay.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.540
<i>Why?</i>

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.880
<i>Why am I the damn medic?</i>

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:25.580
Hit! Medic!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:30.090
<i>I got in a lot of hits in the last battle.</i>

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:31.720
Medic!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:33.800
Okay!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.720
I'm on my way!

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:55.660
Five more minutes.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:58.430
Medics may attack as well.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:00.270
<i>This is it!</i>

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.530
Hit.

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:05.710
Medic!

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.180
Hit.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:11.430
Medic!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.810
I'm hit too.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.350
Medic!

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:24.100
Hit.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.690
Medic!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:30.490
<i>Well, I'm kind of pinned down...</i>

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.920
<i>It'll be quicker to take him out.</i>

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.590
Hit.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:38.280
Medic!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.310
<i>All right!</i>

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.000
Medic!

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:45.750
<i>I could take one more out easily...</i>

00:08:46.470 --> 00:08:47.380
Medic!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.340
Hurry up!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.090
I'm on my way!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:55.220
Hmm...

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.220
You took forever!

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:59.310
I called like a million times!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:01.530
I'm sorry.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.170
36...

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:10.190
37...

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:12.690
38...

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:14.190
That's all.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.700
39.

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:18.700
We've lost.

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:22.890
Yes, we've lost by one bandage.

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:24.410
Thank you.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.920
It was a good match.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:51.050
Why did you make me the combat medic?

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:54.110
Must I repeat myself?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.550
My decision was based on our previous battle.

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:01.740
There is nothing more to it.

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:05.810
I hit four of them in the last five minutes!

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:10.670
And if there hadn't been a medic call, I would've hit one more!

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.630
Your point?

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:18.470
I think we had a chance to win.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:24.390
The world isn't about chance or probability.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.210
A loss is a loss.

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:28.810
Then what did I do wrong?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:32.780
I responded to medic calls and scored hits.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:38.320
If that's why we lost, then what should I have done differently?

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.830
I will not serve you your answers on a silver platter.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.790
You must think and find them yourself.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:08.870
I see.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.310
It wasn't enough, I suppose.

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.600
Of course it wasn't.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.160
We lost.

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:20.240
You want me to get better, right?

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:25.440
Just give it to me straight, then.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:03.110
Yamato.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:12.660
Yura.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.960
Yura, it's me. Rento.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.670
Long time no see.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:24.880
Yura...

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.710
You've gotten so thin...

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:31.680
Are you eating enough?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.440
Are you sleeping enough?

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:36.190
Does it hurt?

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.870
Are you in pain?

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:40.690
Look...

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.420
I'm quite busy.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.440
Would you tell me what you wish of me?

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:48.410
Will you...

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:53.080
Will you really not come back to the C3 club?

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:57.000
You can come back whenever you'd like.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:13:00.960
I'll bake you a cake.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.720
Lots of cookies, too.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:09.570
Oh, if you don't want sweets, I can make pancakes, too.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:10.970
Or maybe...

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:12.930
I don't need it.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:15.430
I don't need...

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:19.060
the C3 club anymore.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:20.750
But...

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.280
The people here...

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.490
all value my skill.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.120
Yura...

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.540
I still have to practice.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:45.340
Hail of Pellets

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:50.350
Rin, I have this week's score reports.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.220
Thank you.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.640
Yamato is quite amazing.

00:13:56.530 --> 00:14:00.410
Scouting, Speed, Accuracy, Stamina...

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:03.190
She's excellent across the board,

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.740
but her hits are off the charts.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:19.960
Listen.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.550
Today's formation will be Oscar.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:26.300
The one trying ambush from the slope will...

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.960
Please.

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:30.540
Please make me an attacker.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:35.310
I'll try to contribute more than I did as a medic.

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.980
I'll make sure we win.

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:39.990
Raise your head.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:44.230
Unfortunately, you'll be the medic again.

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:49.300
Based on the previous battle, I take it?

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:50.870
Yes.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.450
I see.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:58.660
Then I'll bring us victory even as a medic.

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:07.430
Teams taking part in the first match, please proceed to the central grounds.

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:09.910
Let's go.

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:27.200
Last five minutes!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.540
Hit!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.300
<i>We've won.</i>

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.340
Even as a medic, I can make us win.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:56.180
And I'm sure I got the most hits, too!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.680
Make me an attacker.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:00.970
The most hits...

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:03.440
I counted everything.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.770
You scored fifteen hits.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:06.950
I scored—

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:09.190
Are you fighting for your team?

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.710
Or do you fight for your own KDR?

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:17.080
Now, about our formation for the next match...

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.460
<i>I won't talk about the hits I score anymore.</i>

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:29.210
<i>I have to win for the sake of it.</i>

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:35.010
Five minutes left.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.600
Thanks.

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:50.950
No, Yamato!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.240
The enemy here is—

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.580
H-Help!

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.000
Someone!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.350
<i>That wasn't a call for a medic.</i>

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:17.640
<i>I can get the decisive hit in!</i>

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.570
Hit!

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:27.440
We've won.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:34.740
Yamato Yura.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.700
Hand over your gun.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.730
What? But I won it!

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:43.300
The next match is starting soon...

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:44.540
Hand it over.

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:46.580
Why?!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.210
Tell me why!

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:51.130
It's not my fault she got hurt!

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:53.800
That's not the point.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.170
Then what is?

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:58.890
Didn't you tell me that only winning mattered?

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:03.520
I came here to win and to get better, so what gives?!

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:08.680
It seems you've forced your ideals on Sonora and me.

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:13.980
You're trying to find your raison d'être in the praise of others.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:15.990
Is that so wrong?

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:20.990
You only succeed in consigning your happiness to others.

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:22.380
What?

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.310
Just like self-sacrifice,

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:26.470
it serves nobody but yoursel—

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:29.010
No! That's not true!

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:30.800
Oh, it's quite true.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:33.370
It may appear selfless at first glance,

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:36.160
but all you seek is the praise it nets you.

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:37.300
No!

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:39.170
No, no.

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:42.330
No, no, no, no, no!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:47.230
You don't think of anyone besides yourself.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:56.900
You're no longer welcome on this team.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:02.740
The third match will begin shortly.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:07.520
All participating teams are asked to proceed to gate A.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:09.290
All participating teams are...

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:22.470
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.340
<i>How did it come to this?</i>

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:32.730
<i>All I wanted to was to live true to myself.</i>

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:37.300
<i>Some people live by their own rules and are still accepted by those around them.</i>

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.700
<i>I admired those people...</i>

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:41.860
<i>and wanted to be like them.</i>

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.700
<i>I never truly changed.</i>

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:55.180
<i>You only succeed in consigning your happiness to others.</i>

00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:02.390
<i>You don't think of anyone besides yourself.</i>

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.800
<i>Is it too late now?</i>

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:46.890
I can't go back after all this!

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.650
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:02.650
You coming to the clubroom today, Sono?

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:06.610
I'm fine. Nothing's wrong.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:08.690
Hey!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:10.750
You worry too much, Mom.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:13.200
I told you, I'm fine.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.370
Oh, the term abroad?

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.880
I got a response?

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.960
Oh, no, I was just surprised.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.720
I'm not against it.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:30.390
I'd just like to stay in Japan a bit longer.

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:32.370
Okay.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:35.600
I'll tell you once the formalities are taken care of.

00:21:36.860 --> 00:21:38.380
Sweets?

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:41.510
Well, if you send them, I guess I'd eat them...

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:45.400
Yeah, I'd share.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.360
Yeah, yeah.

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:50.570
No, her name's Yura. Not Nura.

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:11.060
Command!

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:12.930
Control!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.190
Communication!

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:16.230
The C3 Club!

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:16.850
Yay!

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:20.070
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:23.400
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:28.530
Smile, 'cause isn't this fun?

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:30.620
Yay!

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:36.750
I blush when I make eye contact with my comrade,

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.580
but that's fine

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:41.710
Let's trust each other and laugh

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:42.710
Ready?

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.220
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:45.220 --> 00:22:48.260
Take your comrade and get the flag!

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.970
Can't you feel your heart thump when you advance?

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.060
Let's hit them and laugh

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:55.980
All right?

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.600
3, 2, 1, go! Go!

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.940
It can be hard, it can be vexing,

00:23:01.940 --> 00:23:04.780
but when you overcome that

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:11.870
you'll smile like you never did before

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.580
Everyone, take up positions!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.120
Okay!

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:18.580
Survival doesn't make the gunshots stop

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.710
Carrying the flag I hear gunfire

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:25.800
Enjoy your youth, even if your tears are stolen

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:31.850
Telepathy, a step forward

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:34.890
Don't look down, look ahead

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.770
Sorry it took me so long to be enthusiastic about it!

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.630
Preview

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:42.090
Gosh, I'm bored.

00:23:42.090 --> 00:23:43.520
Let's play a chain-word game.

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:48.610
asaI'm Extra G, the
amember of the college team
that wasn't able to shake
............ Yura's hand

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:48.610
Hello

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.920
Let's start with A.

00:23:44.920 --> 00:23:48.560
A... America?

00:23:48.560 --> 00:23:50.290
Hey, do you have to bring that up?

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:52.240
It did shock me
quite a bit,

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:53.120
A... A... Airport?

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:55.780
but something else
shocks me more.

00:23:53.120 --> 00:23:57.130
You too? Can't you change the imagery?

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:59.000
I'm short on credits,

00:23:57.130 --> 00:23:58.120
Change the imagery?

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:01.030
T... T... Traitor!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:02.870
so now I have to repeat a year.

00:24:01.030 --> 00:24:02.870
Traitor...

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:09.630
No will to fight anymore.

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:03.450
Next time.

00:24:03.450 --> 00:24:05.090
No will to fight anymore.

00:24:05.090 --> 00:24:08.520
Man, let's just drop this stupid game!
